# BMW 7 Series G11 four-door saloon, 2015-2022.
#
# The sixth 7-series, on the CLAR platform with carbon-fibre structural parts;
# G11 is the standard-wheelbase car and G12 the long-wheelbase one. The G11 is
# modelled.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BMW_7_Series_(G11)
#
# Dimensions 5.098 x 1.902 x 1.478 m, wheelbase 3.070 m, standard wheelbase,
# from the UK launch pricing and specification report (am-online, 13 October
# 2015), which also gives the G12 as 5,238 mm on a 3,210 mm wheelbase. Mirrors
# take the modelled width to 2.134 m.
#
# Colours: the 2015 launch palette, BMW names, as reported for the car and as
# used in the UK configurator:
#   Alpine White (solid)    300
#   Black Sapphire meta.    475
#   Glacier Silver meta.    A83
#   Sophisto Grey meta.     A90
# Exact deletion dates per model year are not published in the sources found,
# so the colours run the generation span here; the header records that
# limitation rather than implying a year-by-year colour card.
# Weights black 3, grey 3, silver 2, white 2, total 10, provisional pending the
# central rebase.
#
# Speed 250 km/h, the electronic limiter on the 730d and 740i. Comfort 175/445,
# on the line 180 + 1.5 x 175, above the F01's 170/435. Class 4, the top band.
#
# Dates are road presence: October 2015 intro, retires staggered 2030-2033 on a
# fifteen- to eighteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bmw-g11.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/bmw-g11.dae (68 objects). References:
# citycars/references/bmw-g11/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Known limitation, recorded rather than corrected: every reference photograph
# is of the 2019 facelift car, so the enlarged one-piece kidney grille and the
# LCI lamps are what is modelled. The 2015 launch car's smaller, separate
# kidneys are NOT represented. The launch dimensions and dates are still those
# of the 2015 car.
#
# Accepted low-poly deviations: the nose and tail are more angular than the
# photographs and the wrap of the rear lamps is simplified. At 128 px the long
# wheelbase, low roof and large grille read correctly.

obj=citycar
name=BMW7G11(BlackSapphire)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=2015
intro_month=10
retire_year=2033
retire_month=6
speed=250
class=4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=175
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=445

Image[E]=./images/bmw-g11-black_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/bmw-g11-black_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/bmw-g11-black_S.0.0,0,0
